  "keyFeatures": [
    "LLM-powered Telegram signal parsing using gemma4:31b-cloud via json-inference tool-grammar for deterministic structured output",
    "Supports both text-only and vision (chart screenshot) signal formats via Ollama multimodal inference",
    "Level-ratchet trailing stop that adapts to the grid density of each signal channel",
    "Dual LLM pipeline for channels where entry and close are separate posts (listenIdlePing + listenActivePing)",
    "Event study toolkit: directional price moves at +15m/+1h/+4h/+12h/+24h after each signal, pre-post drift, zone touch analysis",
    "Cache.file for LLM result persistence (5m/4h interval) to avoid redundant Telegram scrapes and model calls",
    "Per-signal State for ratchet level tracking, breakeven management, and stagnation telemetry",
    "Docker + MongoDB + Redis infrastructure for candle caching and LLM result persistence",
    "Prompt regression suite (validate.mjs) with mandatory cases that fail fast on prompt changes"
  ],
  "publicApiSurface": [
